sequenceDiagram
  participant User as Customer
  participant API as Backend API
  participant Xendit as Xendit
  participant DB as Database

  User->>API: Cari restoran & menu
  API->>DB: Query restoran/menu
  DB-->>API: Daftar restoran & menu
  API-->>User: Tampilkan hasil

  User->>API: Pilih menu + kustomisasi
  User->>API: Buat pesanan (POST /orders)

  API->>DB: Simpan order (PENDING)
  API->>Xendit: Buat invoice pembayaran
  Xendit-->>API: URL invoice

  API-->>User: Redirect ke halaman bayar

  User->>Xendit: Bayar via Xendit
  Xendit->>API: Callback notifikasi bayar
  API->>DB: Update status (PAID)
  API-->>User: Pesanan dikonfirmasi

  Note over User,DB: Vendor proses & siapkan
  Note over User,DB: User ambil/makan
